      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_jTKBMq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What foods pair well with honey?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Honey pairs well with a wide variety of foods including cheese, fruit, nuts, yoghurt, porridge, toast, roasted vegetables and desserts. Different honey varieties have their own flavour profiles, so the best pairing can depend on the honey you choose.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qedMhq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What cheese goes well with honey?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Honey pairs particularly well with cheeses such as Brie, Camembert, goat's cheese, blue cheese and mature Cheddar. Lighter floral honeys work beautifully with soft cheeses, while richer honeys can complement stronger, more mature varieties.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_jrRfhf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What fruit goes well with honey?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Apples, pears, berries, figs, peaches and citrus fruits all pair beautifully with honey. Try drizzling honey over fresh fruit, adding it to yoghurt bowls or using it with baked fruit for a simple dessert.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tG7R97": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What nuts go well with honey?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Walnuts, almonds, pistachios, pecans and cashews all work well with honey. They can be combined on cheese boards, added to breakfast bowls or used together in baking and desserts.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VgQxfn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What savoury foods go well with honey?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Honey works well in glazes, marinades and dressings for foods such as salmon, chicken, halloumi and roasted vegetables. Combining honey with ingredients such as mustard, soy sauce, chilli or citrus can create a balance of sweet and savoury flavours.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
